            "end_line": 25,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// \"bcd\": the same three characters listed individually -> same membership. final CharSet listedBcd = CharSet.getInstance(\"bcd\"); assertContainsExactly_BtoD(listedBcd);"
